Deployment: Cloud-only

Options:
  -a, --all                    Delete all secrets in a realm. Ignored with -i.
  -i, --secret-id <secret-id>  Secret id. If specified, -a is ignored.
  -v, --version <version>      Version of secret.
  -h, --help                   Help
  -hh, --help-more             Help with all options.
  -hhh, --help-all             Help with all options, environment variables, and
                               usage examples.

Rule:
  all of -i, --secret-id <secret-id> + -v, --version <version> are required together -- choose which secret version

